=== Fishing ===
'''Silver Magmafish''' can rarely be fished as a {{Catch|good}} in {{Item|Lava}} on the {{zone|Crimson Isle}}.

=== Seal's Treat Bag ===
{{Green|4x}} '''Silver Magmafish''' is a potential reward from a {{Item|Seal's Treat Bag}}.

=== Odger ===
{{NPCSprite|Odger}} rewards {{Green|20x}} '''Silver Magmafish''' for their Adept [[Trophy Fish]]ing reward. '''Silver Magmafish''' is also given when filleting [[Odger#Filleting|Trophy Fish]]. 

